 * @param {Object} deps - Stores (`projectStore`, `taskStore`, `claimStore`).
 * @param {Object} [opts] - `{ projectIds }` (Runner-enforced allowlist), `{ maxWaitMs, now }` (starvation boost; 0 disables).
